          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h1 id=\"module-02-agent-orchestration\">Module 02: Agent Orchestration</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Real-world AI systems rarely consist of just one mega-prompt. You need <em>Delegation</em>.</span>\n<h3 id=\"sequential-routing\">Sequential Routing</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You can chain and group specialized agents together using <code>SequentialAgent</code>.\nThis standard pattern routes a user's prompt through a strict order (e.g. <code>planner_agent</code> -&gt; <code>researcher_agent</code> -&gt; <code>writer_agent</code>), ensuring tightly controlled state transfer.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
