          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h1 id=\"module-03-advanced-orchestration\">Module 03: Advanced Orchestration</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Why wait sequentially when you can process an entire newspaper concurrently?</span>\n<h3 id=\"parallel-execution-networks\">Parallel Execution Networks</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">By grouping agents inside a <code>ParallelAgent</code>, the ADK will automatically fan-out and spin up identical sub-agents (or wildly different sub-agents) to execute independent work at the exact same time.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>This is exactly how our News Harvester compiled 100+ articles in seconds!</em></span></span>"
          }
        }
